					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-316079#post-3639321</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-316079/snuggle-cuddle-and-protect:the-mean-dragon#post-3639321</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 25 Nov 2017 02:16:43 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>dankaar</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1790336</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Unless there's a critical shortage of D-class, amnestics are likely a better choice in this (rather small-scale) info breach.</p> <p>Hell, the whole treatment regarding it is over the top. Firebombing an area and kidnapping surviving children likely involves a helluva lot more paperwork and cover stories then a quiet surgical strike at whoever was distributing it, or replacing it if it's just a book.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
